      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have appointed former Deputy Commissioner of the Department of Consumer Affairs Walter Hinckley, as my full-time City Hall housing expediter, with a mandate for facilitating private housing construction in New York City. Commissioner Hinckley reports directly to me and will be responsible for working with City agencies to insure the expeditious processing of all requests and applications relating to new private housing construction.",
